bar-module__cJzEcG__logo\" href=\"/Sedat\">Sedat <span class=\"accent-text\">Fahrschule</span></a><div class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__links\"><a href=\"/Sedat#about\">Über uns</a><a href=\"/Sedat#services\">Klassen</a><a href=\"/Sedat#theory\">Theorie</a><a class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__cta\" href=\"/Sedat#contact\">Kontakt</a><div class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__desktopLang\"><div class=\"LanguageMenu-module__ScNcvG__container\"><button class=\"LanguageMenu-module__ScNcvG__trigger\" aria-label=\"Select Language\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><line x1=\"2\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"22\" y2=\"12\"></line><path d=\"M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><div class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__mobileControls\"><div class=\"LanguageMenu-module__ScNcvG__container\"><button class=\"LanguageMenu-module__ScNcvG__trigger\" aria-label=\"Select Language\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><line x1=\"2\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"22\" y2=\"12\"></line><path d=\"M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z\"></path></svg></button></div><button class=\"MobileMenu-module__u4pJBa__trigger  \" aria-label=\"Toggle Menu\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"transition:transform 0.3s ease\"><path d=\"M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"MobileMenu-module__u4pJBa__menu \"><div class=\"MobileMenu-module__u4pJBa__menuContent\"><a href=\"/Sedat#about\">Über uns</a><a href=\"/Sedat#services\">Klassen</a><a href=\"/Sedat#theory\">Theorie</a><a class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__cta\" href=\"/Sedat#contact\">Kontakt</a><div style=\"margin-top:20px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1)\"><a style=\"display:block;font-size:0.9rem;margin-bottom:10px;opacity:0.7\" href=\"/Sedat/legal?tab=impressum\">Impressum</a><a style=\"display:block;font-size:0.9rem;opacity:0.7\" href=\"/Sedat/legal?tab=datenschutz\">Datenschutz</a></div></div></div></div></div></nav><section class=\"Hero-module__ZARIfG__hero\"><div class=\"Hero-module__ZARIfG__overlay\"></div><img alt=\"Fahrschule Sedat Team\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/p/AF1QipPkd13573Ag1IK8cyI0p0MfvjoojCsov7BpKNwW=s1600\"/><div class=\"Hero-module__ZARIfG__content\"><h1 class=\"Hero-module__ZARIfG__title\">Fahrschule<!-- --> <span class=\"accent-text\">Sedat</span></h1><p class=\"Hero-module__ZARIfG__subtitle\">Sicher ans Ziel – mit Kompetenz und Erfahrung. Wir begleiten dich Schritt für Schritt von den ersten Theoriestunden bis zur praktischen Prüfung.</p><div class=\"Hero-module__ZARIfG__buttons\"><a href=\"#contact\" class=\"Hero-module__ZARIfG__primaryBtn premium-gradient\">Anmelden</a><a href=\"#about\" class=\"Hero-module__ZARIfG__secondaryBtn\">Über uns</a></div></div></section><section id=\"about\" class=\"About-module__vAULUW__about\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"About-module__vAULUW__grid\"><div class=\"About-module__vAULUW__content\"><h2 class=\"About-module__vAULUW__heading\">Über<!-- --> <span class=\"accent-text\">uns</span></h2><p>Unsere Fahrschule in Duisburg-Rheinhausen begleitet dich zuverlässig auf deinem Weg zum Führerschein. Unser Team erfahrener Fahrlehrer:innen (m/w/d) begleitet dich Schritt für Schritt von den ersten Theoriestunden bis zur praktischen Prüfung.</p><p>Bei uns bist du nicht nur Fahrschüler:in, du wirst Teil unserer Fahrschul-Familie. Wir legen Wert auf ein freundliches Miteinander, individuelle Betreuung und ein Lernen, das Spaß macht und sicher ist.</p><div class=\"About-module__vAULUW__features\"><div class=\"About-module__vAULUW__featureItem\"><span class=\"About-module__vAULUW__check\">✓</span> <!-- -->Freundliche Fahrlehrer/innen</div><div class=\"About-module__vAULUW__featureItem\"><span class=\"About-module__vAULUW__check\">✓</span> <!-- -->Moderne Ausbildungsfahrzeuge</div><div class=\"About-module__vAULUW__featureItem\"><span class=\"About-module__vAULUW__check\">✓</span> <!-- -->Entspannte Atmosphäre</div></div></div><div class=\"About-module__vAULUW__imageWrapper\"><img alt=\"Unser Schulungsfahrzeug\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"600\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"About-module__vAULUW__image\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/assets/car1.jpg\"/></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding Pricing-module__yc4bBa__pricingSection\" id=\"pricing\"><div class=\"container Pricing-module__yc4bBa__container\"><h2 class=\"section-title\">Unsere <!-- --> <span class=\"accent-text\">Preise</span></h2><div class=\"glass-card Pricing-module__yc4bBa__placeholderCard\"><p>Hier kommt bald die Preisvorstellung oder -tabelle hin.</p><div class=\"Pricing-module__yc4bBa__imagePlaceholder\">[ Hier kann ein Bild oder eine Tabelle mit Preisen eingefügt werden / Place for price image or table ]</div></div></div></section><section id=\"services\" class=\"LicenseClasses-module__wRAglW__classes\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"LicenseClasses-module__wRAglW__heading\">Unsere<!-- --> <span class=\"accent-text\">Klassen</span></h2><div class=\"LicenseClasses-module__wRAglW__grid\"><div class=\"LicenseClasses-module__wRAglW__card glass\"><div class=\"LicenseClasses-module__wRAglW__icon\" style=\"color:var(--accent);height:64px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\"><svg width=\"64\" height=\"64\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"48\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"48\" cy=\"48\" r=\"6\"></circle><path d=\"M10 48H6V32H10L16 20H40L46 32H58V48H54\"></path><path d=\"M22 48H42\"></path><path d=\"M32 20V32\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path><path d=\"M10 32H58\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path></svg></div><h3>Klasse B</h3><p>Auto (Schaltgetriebe)</p></div><div class=\"LicenseClasses-module__wRAglW__card glass\"><div class=\"LicenseClasses-module__wRAglW__icon\" style=\"color:var(--accent);height:64px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\"><svg width=\"64\" height=\"64\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"48\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"48\" cy=\"48\" r=\"6\"></circle><path d=\"M10 48H6V32H10L16 20H40L46 32H58V48H54\"></path><path d=\"M22 48H42\"></path><path d=\"M32 20V32\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path><path d=\"M10 32H58\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path></svg></div><h3>Klasse B197</h3><p>Automatik-Ausbildung</p></div><div class=\"LicenseClasses-module__wRAglW__card glass\"><div class=\"LicenseClasses-module__wRAglW__icon\" style=\"color:var(--accent);height:64px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\"><svg width=\"64\" height=\"64\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"48\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"48\" cy=\"48\" r=\"6\"></circle><path d=\"M10 48H6V32H10L16 20H40L46 32H58V48H54\"></path><path d=\"M22 48H42\"></path><path d=\"M32 20V32\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path><path d=\"M10 32H58\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path></svg></div><h3>Klasse B78</h3><p>Autom. (Elektro)</p></div><div class=\"LicenseClasses-module__wRAglW__card glass\"><div class=\"LicenseClasses-module__wRAglW__icon\" style=\"color:var(--accent);height:64px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\"><svg width=\"64\" height=\"64\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 44H4V36H8L12 28H24L28 36H34V44H30\"></path><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"44\" r=\"4\"></circle><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"44\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M34 40H40\"></path><path d=\"M40 34H60V44H56\"></path><path d=\"M40 44H40V34\"></path><circle cx=\"52\" cy=\"44\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M48 44H44\"></path></svg></div><h3>Klasse BE</h3><p>PKW + Anhänger</p></div><div class=\"LicenseClasses-module__wRAglW__card glass\"><div class=\"LicenseClasses-module__wRAglW__icon\" style=\"color:var(--accent);height:64px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\"><svg width=\"64\" height=\"64\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 44H4V36H8L12 28H24L28 36H34V44H30\"></path><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"44\" r=\"4\"></circle><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"44\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M34 40H38\"></path><path d=\"M38 44H48\"></path><circle cx=\"52\" cy=\"44\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M56 44H60V22H38V44\"></path> <path d=\"M38 28H60\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path> <rect x=\"44\" y=\"26\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect> </svg></div><h3>B96</h3><p>PKW + Wohnwagen</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding Reviews-module__yTtV6W__reviewsSection\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"container Reviews-module__yTtV6W__container\"><h2 class=\"section-title\">Kunden<!-- --> <span class=\"accent-text\">stimmen</span></h2><div class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__carouselWrapper\"><div class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__carouselInfo\"><div class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__googleIconWrapper\"><svg class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__googleIcon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"#4285F4\" d=\"M22.56 12.25c0-.78-.07-1.53-.2-2.25H12v4.26h5.92c-.26 1.37-1.04 2.53-2.21 3.31v2.77h3.57c2.08-1.92 3.28-4.74 3.28-8.09z\"></path><path fill=\"#34A853\" d=\"M12 23c2.97 0 5.46-.98 7.28-2.66l-3.57-2.77c-.98.66-2.23 1.06-3.71 1.06-2.86 0-5.29-1.93-6.16-4.53H2.15v2.84C3.99 20.53 7.7 23 12 23z\"></path><path fill=\"#FBBC05\" d=\"M5.84 14.09c-.22-.66-.35-1.36-.35-2.09s.13-1.43.35-2.09V7.07H2.15C1.43 8.55 1 10.22 1 12s.43 3.45 1.15 4.93l3.69-2.84z\"></path><path fill=\"#EA4335\" d=\"M12 5.38c1.62 0 3.06.56 4.21 1.64l3.15-3.15C17.45 2.09 14.97 1 12 1 7.7 1 3.99 3.47 2.15 7.07l3.69 2.84c.87-2.6 3.3-4.53 6.16-4.53z\"></path></svg><span class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__googleText\">Google Bewertungen</span></div></div><div class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__carousel\"><div class=\"glass-card Reviews-module__yTtV6W__reviewCard\"><div class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__cardHeader\"><div class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__avatar\">M</div><div class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__authorInfo\"><h4>Max Mustermann</h4><div class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__ratingInfo\"><div class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__stars\"><span class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__starFilled\">★</span><span class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__starFilled\">★</span><span class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__starFilled\">★</span><span class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__starFilled\">★</span><span class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__starFilled\">★</span></div><span class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__time\">vor 2 Wochen</span></div></div></div><p class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__reviewText\">Super Fahrschule! Ich habe meinen Führerschein beim ersten Mal bestanden.</p></div><div class=\"glass-card Reviews-module__yTtV6W__reviewCard\"><div class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__cardHeader\"><div class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__avatar\">A</div><div class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__authorInfo\"><h4>Anna Schmidt</h4><div class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__ratingInfo\"><div class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__stars\"><span class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__starFilled\">★</span><span class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__starFilled\">★</span><span class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__starFilled\">★</span><span class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__starFilled\">★</span><span class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__starFilled\">★</span></div><span class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__time\">vor 1 Monat</span></div></div></div><p class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__reviewText\">Sehr geduldige Fahrlehrer und angenehme Atmosphäre. Kann ich nur weiterempfehlen!</p></div><div class=\"glass-card Reviews-module__yTtV6W__reviewCard\"><div class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__cardHeader\"><div class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__avatar\">A</div><div class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__authorInfo\"><h4>Ali Yilmaz</h4><div class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__ratingInfo\"><div class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__stars\"><span class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__starFilled\">★</span><span class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__starFilled\">★</span><span class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__starFilled\">★</span><span class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__starFilled\">★</span><span class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__starFilled\">★</span></div><span class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__time\">vor 3 Monaten</span></div></div></div><p class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__reviewText\">Tolles Team, sehr moderne Autos. Hat viel Spaß gemacht!</p></div><div class=\"glass-card Reviews-module__yTtV6W__reviewCard\"><div class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__cardHeader\"><div class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__avatar\">E</div><div class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__authorInfo\"><h4>Elena Petrova</h4><div class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__ratingInfo\"><div class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__stars\"><span class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__starFilled\">★</span><span class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__starFilled\">★</span><span class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__starFilled\">★</span><span class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__starFilled\">★</span><span class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__starFilled\">★</span></div><span class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__time\">vor 4 Monaten</span></div></div></div><p class=\"Reviews-module__yTtV6W__reviewText\">Alles lief perfekt, schnelle Terminvergabe und gute Vorbereitung auf die Prüfung.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"theory\" class=\"Theory-module__nYkYYq__theory\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"Theory-module__nYkYYq__box premium-gradient\"><div class=\"Theory-module__nYkYYq__imageOverlay\"><img alt=\"Theorieunterricht\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent;opacity:0.2\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/p/AF1QipPWgpeMF-l8cMvB_SVzsHgEvN5J-7Jg0UDGJc3a=s1600\"/></div><div class=\"Theory-module__nYkYYq__content\"><h2>Theorieunterricht</h2><p>Feste Theoriezeiten – ideal zum Planen</p><div class=\"Theory-module__nYkYYq__schedule\"><div class=\"Theory-module__nYkYYq__day\"><span>Dienstag</span><strong>18:00 - 19:30 Uhr</strong></div><div class=\"Theory-module__nYkYYq__day\"><span>Donnerstag</span><strong>18:00 - 19:30 Uhr</strong></div></div><p class=\"Theory-module__nYkYYq__note\">In unseren modernen Unterrichtsräumen</p><div class=\"Theory-module__nYkYYq__socialInline\"><span class=\"Theory-module__nYkYYq__socialLabel\">Jetzt kontaktieren:</span><div class=\"SocialButtons-module__yguKWG__socialWrapper\"><a href=\"https://wa.me/491772650676\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"SocialButtons-module__yguKWG__button SocialButtons-module__yguKWG__whatsapp\" aria-label=\"WhatsApp\"><svg class=\"SocialButtons-module__yguKWG__icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.4